* ts808-cerutti-reduced-v1. Prepared at 298.15 K, no native D/Q defaults.
* Branch currents positive into device; reduced laws only, no semiconductor charge.
.param VT808={1.380649e-23*298.15/1.602176634e-19}
.func em808(x) {exp(x)-1}
.subckt reduced_diode a k
Bjunction a k I={3.0193620074088285e-9*em808(V(a,k)/(1.94*VT808))}
.ends reduced_diode

.subckt reduced_npn c b e
.param IS808=1.1792496052020765e-14 BF808=271.5505716517182 BR808=4.2141277418153207
.param AF808={BF808/(BF808+1)} AR808={BR808/(BR808+1)}
.func f808(x) {IS808/AF808*em808(x/(0.99569*VT808))}
.func r808(x) {IS808/AR808*em808(x/VT808)}
Bcollector c e I={AF808*f808(V(b,e))-r808(V(b,c))}
Bbase b e I={(1-AF808)*f808(V(b,e))+(1-AR808)*r808(V(b,c))}
.ends reduced_npn

* Explicit pins: plus minus output positive_supply negative_supply.
* Both channels use this law with distinct internal z state nodes.
.subckt reduced_4558 plus minus out vp vn
.param A808=100000 GBW808=3e6 SR808=1e6 R808={10000/51} TAU808=10u
.param W808=0.25 HR808={37/51}
.func sat808(z,h) {if(z>h-W808,h-W808+W808*tanh((z-h+W808)/W808),if(z<-(h-W808),-h+W808-W808*tanh((-z-h+W808)/W808),z))}
.func drive808(e,z,h) {2*pi*GBW808/A808*(A808*e-z)-(z-sat808(z,h))/TAU808}
Rid plus minus 5meg
Ibplus plus vn 25n
Ibminus minus vn 25n
* Exact state-law decomposition: Rstate removes a structural floating-node warning.
* Its 1e-9*z current is compensated in Bstate; no physical shunt is added.
* Numerical row scale 1e-6: C and behavioral current scaled together.
* z remains volts; the differential equation is unchanged.
Cstate z vn 1u
Rstate z vn 1e9
Bstate vn z I={1e-6*SR808*tanh(drive808(V(plus,minus),V(z,vn),V(vp,vn)/2-HR808)/SR808)+1e-9*V(z,vn)}
Bdrive internal vn V={V(vp,vn)/2+sat808(V(z,vn),V(vp,vn)/2-HR808)}
Rout out internal {R808}
.ends reduced_4558
